  "result": "`countLines` is added and committed. `npm run fast` passed with 18 tests.\n\n- **Function:** `src/cli/count-lines.ts` returns 0 for an empty string, and a trailing newline doesn't add a line. `\"a\\nb\\n\"` counts as 2 and `\"\\n\"` counts as 1.\n- **Tests:** `test/cli/count-lines.test.ts` uses `node:test` and covers empty text, text with and without a trailing newline, and blank lines.\n- **Shard weight:** I added `test/cli/count-lines.test.ts` to `scripts/lib/shard-weights.mjs`, as the repo conventions require for new test files.\n- **Plan notes:** The plan is at `.krn/runs/worker/plan.md`. It's git-ignored, and I ticked off each step as I went.\n- **Commit title:** My brief had no task id, so the title is \"Add countLines for CLI text\" with no `(<task id>)` suffix. If you give me the id, I can amend the title.",
